(3. Data points) Tj T*
(Identity: GTIN or internal article number, batch number, production country.) Tj T*
(Materials: fibre composition by weight, recycled content, yarn spinner, yarn lot number.) Tj T*
(Production steps: knitting technique \(flat, circular, whole garment\), dyeing method,) Tj T*
(finishing chemicals, factory location.) Tj T*
(Use and care: washing temperature, drying, pilling class.) Tj T*
(Repair: spare yarn availability, repair service contact role.) Tj T*
(End of life: take-back scheme, sorting code, recyclability score.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Open template) Tj T*
(An open spreadsheet template and a JSON schema implementing this model are published with) Tj T*
(this deliverable. The pilot knitters in the Netherlands and Portugal filled in passports) Tj T*
(for 120 styles in three months.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
